<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>本格的映像制作パッケージ - 株式会社ミユキット</title>
    <meta name="description" content="映像は、消費するものではなく「会社の資産」になる。神戸で35年のITインフラ企業「ミユキット」が提案する、結果にコミットするプロフェッショナル映像制作。">
    <!-- Font Awesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;700&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <link rel="icon" href="favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">

    <style>
        /* =========================================================
           Advanced Typography & Japanese Kerning
           ========================================================= */
        body, p, h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, li, span, div {
            word-break: auto-phrase;  /* Automatic phrase-based wrap on modern browsers */
            font-feature-settings: "palt" 1; /* Proportional Alternate kerning for immaculate Japanese spacing */
        }

        /* =========================================================
           Advanced LP Styles
           ========================================================= */
        :root {
            --lp-hero-overlay: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            --lp-card-bg: #ffffff;
            --lp-border: #e0e0e0;
        }

        /* ------------------ 1. Hero Section ------------------ */
        .lp-hero-section {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 90vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            padding: 120px 5vw 4rem;
            /* offset for nav */
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
        }

        .lp-hero-bg {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .lp-hero-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--lp-hero-overlay) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) 100%);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .lp-hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            max-width: 800px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            padding: 4rem;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .lp-hero-content {
                padding: 1.5rem;
                max-width: 100%;
            }

            .lp-hero-overlay {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); /* Slightly more opaque for mobile text readability */
            }
        }

        .lp-hero-catch {
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--primary-text);
            line-height: 1.35;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            word-break: auto-phrase;
        }

        .lp-hero-catch span.highlight {
            color: var(--accent-orange);
            background: linear-gradient(transparent 65%, rgba(245, 166, 35, 0.3) 65%);
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0 0.2rem;
        }

        .lp-hero-sub {
            font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.4rem);
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--secondary-text);
            line-height: 1.8;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-orange);
            padding-left: 1rem;
        }

        /* ------------------ 2. Features Section ------------------ */
        .features-section {
            padding: 6rem 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-light-gray);
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .features-image-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
            aspect-ratio: 16/9;
        }

        .features-image-wrapper img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        .features-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            background: var(--lp-card-bg);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--accent-orange);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .feature-text h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--primary-text);
        }

        .feature-text p {
            color: var(--secondary-text);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ------------------ 3. Pricing Section (Cards) ------------------ */
        .pricing-section {
            padding: 6rem 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
        }

        .pricing-cards-container {
            margin-top: 4rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            align-items: stretch;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .pricing-cards-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .pricing-card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
            padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
            border: 1px solid var(--lp-border);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .pricing-card.bamboo-card {
            background-color: #fffaf0;
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-orange);
            transform: scale(1.05);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .pricing-card.bamboo-card {
                transform: none;
            }
        }

        .card-header {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bg-light-gray);
        }
        
        .card-header.th-plum { color: var(--accent-green); }
        .card-header.th-bamboo { color: var(--accent-orange); }
        .card-header.th-pine { color: #d4a017; }

        .card-price {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        
        .card-price span {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .card-price.plum { color: var(--accent-green); }
        .card-price.bamboo { color: var(--accent-orange); }
        .card-price.pine { color: #d4a017; }

        .card-features {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .card-features li {
            padding: 1.2rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bg-light-gray);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--primary-text);
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.5;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .card-features li:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .feature-label {
            display: block;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--secondary-text);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .card-features small {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--secondary-text);
        }

        .bamboo-badge {
            background-color: var(--accent-orange);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 0.3rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            white-space: nowrap;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(245, 166, 35, 0.3);
        }

        /* ------------------ Equipment Section ------------------ */
        .equipment-section {
            padding: 6rem 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-light-gray);
        }

        .equipment-layout {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .equipment-layout {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .equipment-image-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
            aspect-ratio: 16/9;
        }

        .equipment-image-wrapper img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        .equipment-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .equipment-list li {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-orange);
        }

        .equipment-list li h4 {
            color: var(--accent-orange);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .equipment-list li p {
            color: var(--primary-text);
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* ------------------ 4. Works Section ------------------ */
        .works-section {
            padding: 6rem 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
        }

        .works-grid-top {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .works-grid-bottom {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {

            .works-grid-top,
            .works-grid-bottom {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .video-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            padding-bottom: 56.25%;
            height: 0;
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            background: #e0e0e0;
        }

        .video-wrapper iframe,
        .video-wrapper img {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: 0;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .dummy-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            color: var(--secondary-text);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        /* ------------------ 5. Company & CTA ------------------ */
        .company-section {
            padding: 6rem 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
        }

        .company-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .company-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
            }
        }

        table.company-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        table.company-table th,
        table.company-table td {
            padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bg-light-gray);
            text-align: left;
        }

        table.company-table th {
            width: 35%;
            color: var(--accent-orange);
            font-weight: 700;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        table.company-table td {
            color: var(--primary-text);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .map-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            padding-bottom: 75%;
            height: 0;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        }

        .map-wrapper iframe {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: 0;
        }

        .cta-bottom {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 5rem;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            background: var(--bg-light-gray);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
            border: 2px dashed var(--accent-orange);
        }

        .cta-big-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--accent-orange);
            color: #fff !important;
            padding: 1.5rem 5rem;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(245, 166, 35, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .cta-big-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(245, 166, 35, 0.6);
        }

        /* =========================================================
           Print Optimization (PDF Layout) 
           ========================================================= */
        @media print {
            body {
                background: #fff !important;
                color: #000;
                font-size: 10pt;
                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important;
                print-color-adjust: exact !important;
            }

            /* Hide Web-only Elements */
            .navbar,
            .site-footer,
            .menu-toggle,
            .cta-big-btn,
            .cta-secondary-text,
            .works-section,
            .lp-hero-overlay {
                display: none !important;
            }

            /* Prevent Page Break Issues */
            .pricing-table-wrapper,
            .feature-item,
            table.company-table,
            .lp-hero-content,
            .map-wrapper {
                page-break-inside: avoid !important;
                break-inside: avoid !important;
            }

            /* Reset Containers */
            .container {
                padding: 0 !important;
                max-width: 100% !important;
            }

            section {
                padding: 1.5rem 0 !important;
                background: transparent !important;
            }

            /* Hero Optimization for Print */
            .lp-hero-section {
                min-height: auto;
                padding: 0 !important;
                justify-content: flex-start;
            }

            .lp-hero-bg {
                position: relative;
                height: 300px;
                border-radius: 12px;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }

            .lp-hero-content {
                box-shadow: none !important;
                padding: 0;
                max-width: 100%;
                background: transparent !important;
                border-radius: 0;
            }

            .lp-hero-catch {
                font-size: 24pt;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
            }

            .lp-hero-sub {
                font-size: 14pt;
                border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-orange);
                padding-left: 1rem;
            }

            /* Features Grid */
            .features-grid {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
            }

            .features-image-wrapper {
                height: 250px;
                width: 100%;
                aspect-ratio: auto;
            }

            .feature-item {
                padding: 1rem;
                border: 1px solid #ddd;
                box-shadow: none !important;
            }

            /* Pricing Cards Print */
            .pricing-cards-container {
                display: flex !important;
                flex-direction: row;
                gap: 1rem;
            }

            .pricing-card {
                flex: 1;
                box-shadow: none !important;
                border: 1px solid #ddd;
                padding: 1rem;
                page-break-inside: avoid;
                break-inside: avoid;
            }

            .pricing-card.bamboo-card {
                transform: none !important;
                border: 2px solid var(--accent-orange);
            }

            .bamboo-badge {
                box-shadow: none !important;
                border-radius: 4px;
            }

            .card-features li {
                padding: 0.5rem 0;
            }

            .card-price {
                font-size: 18pt;
                margin: 0.5rem 0;
            }

            /* Equipment Layout Print */
            .equipment-layout {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
            }

            .equipment-image-wrapper {
                height: 250px;
                width: 100%;
                aspect-ratio: auto;
                box-shadow: none !important;
                border: 1px solid #ddd;
            }

            .equipment-list li {
                box-shadow: none !important;
                border: 1px solid #ddd;
                border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-orange) !important;
                padding: 1rem;
                break-inside: avoid;
                page-break-inside: avoid;
            }

            .equipment-section {
                background: transparent !important;
                break-inside: avoid;
                page-break-inside: avoid;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
                padding: 1rem 0 !important;
            }

            .ai-section {
                background: transparent !important;
                break-inside: avoid;
                page-break-inside: avoid;
                margin-top: 1rem;
                padding: 1rem 0 !important;
            }

            .ai-grid {
                display: flex !important;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem !important;
            }

            .ai-video-wrapper {
                display: none !important;
            }

            /* Company Grid */
            .company-grid {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
            }

            .map-wrapper {
                height: 200px;
                padding-bottom: 0;
                border: 1px solid #ddd;
                box-shadow: none !important;
            }

            /* CTA Replacement */
            .cta-bottom {
                background: none !important;
                border: 2px solid var(--accent-orange) !important;
                padding: 1rem;
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: 1rem;
            }

            .print-qr-section {
                display: block !important;
                margin-top: 1rem;
            }

            @page {
                margin: 15mm;
                size: A4 portrait;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <!-- HEADER_BLOCK -->
    <header class="navbar">
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="index.html" class="logo"><img src="miucuit_logo.png" alt="ミユキット ロゴ"></a>
            <div class="menu-toggle" id="mobile-menu">
                <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
            <nav class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
                <a href="index.html">Home<span class="en">HOME</span></a>
                <a href="company.html">About<span class="en">企業について</span></a>
                <a href="service.html">IT & Services<span class="en">システム・IT基盤</span></a>
                <div class="has-dropdown">
                    <span class="nav-item-title">Creative<span class="en">コンテンツ制作</span></span>
                    <div class="dropdown-menu">
                        <a href="service.html#web">WEBサイト・グラフィック制作</a>
                        <a href="video.html">成果の出る動画・映像制作</a>
                        <a href="lp-video.html">映像制作パッケージ</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <a href="products.html">Products<span class="en">取扱商品一覧</span></a>
                <a href="store.html">Store<span class="en">実店舗（美幸商店）</span></a>
                <a href="#contact" class="nav-contact-btn">お問い合わせ</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO_BLOCK -->
    <section class="lp-hero-section">
        <img class="lp-hero-bg" src="lp_hero_image.png" alt="動画編集を行うクリエイター">
        <div class="lp-hero-overlay"></div>
        <div class="container" style="z-index: 2;">
            <div class="lp-hero-content fade-up">
                <h1 class="lp-hero-catch">
                    <span style="display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;">映像は、</span><span style="display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;">消費するものではなく</span><br>
                    <span style="display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;"><span class="highlight">『会社の資産』</span>になる。</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="lp-hero-sub">神戸で35年、オフィスのITインフラを支えてきたミユキットが提案する、結果にコミットするプロフェッショナル映像制作。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FEATURES_BLOCK -->
    <section class="features-section">
        <div class="container fade-up">


            <div class="features-grid">
                <!-- Visual Left -->
                <div class="features-image-wrapper fade-up delay-1">
                    <img src="lp_equipment_image.png" alt="シネマカメラとプロフェッショナル機材">
                </div>

                <!-- 4 Reasons Right -->
                <div class="features-list">
                    <div class="feature-item fade-up delay-1">
                        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-yen-sign"></i></div>
                        <div class="feature-text">
                            <h3>圧倒的なコストパフォーマンス</h3>
                            <p>一般的な相場30万〜50万円のところ、内製化と徹底した効率化によりローコストで高品質な映像を実現します。無駄な中間マージンをカットし、お客様の予算を最大限に活かします。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="feature-item fade-up delay-2">
                        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-video"></i></div>
                        <div class="feature-text">
                            <h3>プロフェッショナル機材の導入</h3>
                            <p>シネマカメラ「SONY FX3」をはじめとする最新の撮影機材を使用。企業の魅力を映画のような美しく洗練された映像で切り取り、視聴者の心を強くインスパイアします。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="feature-item fade-up delay-3">
                        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i></div>
                        <div class="feature-text">
                            <h3>ITインフラとのシームレス連携</h3>
                            <p>映像を作って終わりではありません。社内ネットワークでの安全な動画配信や、WEBサイトへの組み込み、デジタルサイネージの運用まで、IT企業ならではのワンストップサポートを提供します。
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="feature-item fade-up delay-4">
                        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-building-shield"></i></div>
                        <div class="feature-text">
                            <h3>自治体対応の信頼性</h3>
                            <p>市役所などの行政案件も手がける、実績豊富なスタッフがサポートいたします！機密情報の取り扱いやセキュリティ対策も万全ですので、初めての映像制作でも安心してお任せください。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRICING_BLOCK -->
    <section class="pricing-section">
        <div class="container fade-up">
            <div class="center">
                <span class="section-tag">Pricing</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">制作プラン（比較表）</h2>
